		(property "Note" "TOP of a two-can stack with C420 -- 41 uF, 160 V. The converter cannot deliver 18 A; it delivers a trickle and this stack delivers the pulse. 342 uC per peak phase gives 8.3 V of droop, 14.9 V on the smallest aged stack."
